  "summary": "A product-led commerce recipe balancing strong brand expression with search, comparison, trust, price clarity, and low-friction purchase flows.",
  "problem": "Commerce interfaces underperform when brand spectacle obscures product information, filters, price, delivery state, or purchase consequences.",
